	<section_number>45.2-1218</section_number>
	<catch_line> Priority of lien</catch_line>
	<text>
		Any lien acquired under this article shall have priority as a lien second only to the lien of real estate taxes imposed upon the land.
	</text>
	<history>2017, c. 4, § 45.1-186.6; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 387.</history>
